msgid "Organisation, in der die Rollen verfügbar sind."
msgstr "Organization where the roles are available."

# Provides a complete explanation of the meaning of the data element for human readability.  For the case of elements derived from existing elements (e.g. constraints), the definition SHALL be consistent with the base definition, but convey the meaning of the element in the particular context of use of the resource. (Note: The text you are reading is specified in ElementDefinition.definition).
#: StructureDefinition.element.PractitionerRole.organization/definition
msgid "Die Organisation, in der der Praktiker die zugeordneten Rollen ausübt."
msgstr "The organization where the Practitioner performs the roles associated."

# A concise description of what this element means (e.g. for use in autogenerated summaries).
#: StructureDefinition.element.PractitionerRole.code/short
msgid "Berufliche Rolle in der Organisation, nicht die Rolle in der Studie."
msgstr "Professional role within the organization, not the role in the study."

# Provides a complete explanation of the meaning of the data element for human readability.  For the case of elements derived from existing elements (e.g. constraints), the definition SHALL be consistent with the base definition, but convey the meaning of the element in the particular context of use of the resource. (Note: The text you are reading is specified in ElementDefinition.definition).
#: StructureDefinition.element.PractitionerRole.code/definition
msgid "Rollen, die dieser Praktiker für die Organisation ausüben darf."
msgstr "Roles which this practitioner is authorized to perform for the organization."

# Explanatory notes and implementation guidance about the data element, including notes about how to use the data properly, exceptions to proper use, etc. (Note: The text you are reading is specified in ElementDefinition.comment).
#: StructureDefinition.element.PractitionerRole.code/comment
msgid "Die Rolle der Person in einer bestimmten Studie wird nicht hier angegeben, sondern in ResearchStudy.extension:AssociatedParty.extension:role. Für die Studienleitung wird ResearchStudy.principalInvestigator verwendet."
msgstr "The role of the person in a specific study is not given here but in ResearchStudy.extension:AssociatedParty.extension:role. For the study lead, ResearchStudy.principalInvestigator is used."

